sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Device supervisor
    participant Token as Runtime token service
    participant MQTT as MQTT broker
    Note over Client: Decode exp for scheduling only
    opt Previous worker exists
        Client->>MQTT: DISCONNECT previous worker
    end
    alt Current token still valid with renewal margin
        Client->>Token: HTTPS POST /refresh_token (refresh_token=current access token)
        alt Reissue succeeds
            Token-->>Client: 200 replacement runtime token and MQTT metadata
        else HTTP 401
            Token-->>Client: 401
            Client->>Token: mTLS POST /request_token (scope=device, devid)
            Token-->>Client: New token or bootstrap error
        else Forbidden or transient error
            Token-->>Client: 403 or transient status
            Note over Client: Stop on 403, bounded backoff for transient errors
        end
    else Expired or no current token
        Client->>Token: mTLS POST /request_token (scope=device, devid)
        Token-->>Client: New token or bootstrap error
    end
    opt Replacement validated
        Client->>MQTT: TLS and CONNECT with new credentials
        MQTT-->>Client: CONNACK
        Note over Client,MQTT: Restore subscriptions, then GET current state
    end
